{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_8000_situation", "source_sha256": "df7e905582089f19789355d95376536c02e33291bec3890e35ab61b7a6d69c3a", "ja": "グラビアのお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_8000_place", "source_sha256": "dc2eab181b21579d24af8758a5c8880d3a25c4048161584a8837b0a8c92754ca", "ja": "控え室", "zh": "准备室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_8001_p", "source_sha256": "9c41947c7796f84d99df5ee6381fd68843ecc73077e6bae73f8089969a2295b7", "ja": "（今日はアイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア\n企画。響はプールサイドで撮影する予定だ）", "zh": "（今天是为偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》拍摄写真企划。响预定在泳池边进行拍摄）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_8002_013hib", "source_sha256": "fa8db95dbf82b5df16c8ebab46b2eae96f45be1676922566b56c3b33d13cf967", "ja": "プールって、なんかワクワクするよね！\n最近泳いでなかったから、すごくうれしいぞー！", "zh": "泳池什么的，总让人觉得兴奋呢！\n最近都没游泳，真的好开心啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_8003_p", "source_sha256": "dbd796ea35d6a8d00db138c578f49c125f27c4197ef27d55677dcb6eff08687a", "ja": "ははっ、響が楽しそうでよかった。\nこの調子で撮影も頑張ろうな。", "zh": "哈哈，响看起来很开心，我就放心了。\n就保持这个状态，拍摄也要加油啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_8004_013hib", "source_sha256": "eb60eca4ed87e64cc2da6dcb470dd9415cf4eeb0d0319c98f6708aae45a5275e", "ja": "うん！　ねえ、{$P$}。撮影が\n終わったらプールで泳ぎたいんだけど……ダメかな？", "zh": "嗯！那个，{$P$}。拍摄\n结束后我想去泳池游泳……不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_8005_p", "source_sha256": "03456dbe8af767c79614e13acdbd391c452d9737e1d174a6a820095257a987b9", "ja": "大丈夫じゃないか？　撮影が終われば自由だし。\n……ん？　荷物が多いと思ってたけど、もしかして！？", "zh": "没问题吧？拍摄结束之后就是自由时间了。\n……嗯？我说怎么行李那么多，难道说！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_8006_013hib", "source_sha256": "58b18559b2f89c6f8b054366a8c53a7b32b510a8c79948afa05ea69147210a6a", "ja": "ふっふっふ～。準備はバッチリだぞ！\n泳ぐ用の水着だって、しっかり持ってきて……あれ？", "zh": "呵呵呵～准备得万无一失哦！连游泳用的泳衣都好好带来了……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_8007_013hib", "source_sha256": "a607095377a723cbe42924d4d1b0965ce4b99d304d0c62cb6eeefcf7142dcf84", "ja": "うぎゃーっ！　無い……水着が無いぞ！？\nちゃんと準備してきたのに！　どうしよう～！？", "zh": "哇啊——！没有……泳衣不见了！？\n明明好好准备了的！怎么办啊～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_8008", "source_sha256": "38f0d500ec2570ca8691300448a418eca3539fefe9c4d1b53163149be9b04433", "ja": "レンタルする", "zh": "租借", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_8009", "source_sha256": "576fb6462fb578a47742796df49477c25b39113cc029e19b87f23d26af4b9c04", "ja": "次回にする", "zh": "下次再做", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_8010", "source_sha256": "52dd8ecf405871c574221bb84317a8ef625bfa4aaabc9bb2416d9730ee7ada6f", "ja": "お祈りする", "zh": "祈祷", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_8100_p", "source_sha256": "e0cd8699b8d4238b5b9b563ade2f5b9192a07d79880e162288917cf1e4d305d6", "ja": "確か、水着のレンタルをやってたはずだ。\n撮影が終わったら行ってみようか。", "zh": "我记得这里好像有租借泳装的服务。\n拍摄结束后要不要去看看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_8101_013hib", "source_sha256": "ad6325287857ebfcc967c6b52556a9998d9bb7a1988e199e76051ff28d365121", "ja": "ホント！？　よ、よかった……。\nこれで安心して、撮影できるぞ。", "zh": "真的吗！？太、太好了……这样就能放心拍摄了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_8102_013hib", "source_sha256": "387c5fe1b9b5b63b0fffd05cb536de129cc7e2cb16df1c425cf2e98388428488", "ja": "本番も、いっぱい頑張るから見ててよね。\nお仕事が終わったら、思いっきり泳ぐぞー！　えへへ♪", "zh": "正式演出时我也会努力加油的，要看着我哦。\n工作结束后，我要尽情游泳——！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_8200_p", "source_sha256": "68ad2152d067e1d047b146cc980a7d283f8e864d729207396339670f0443ba3e", "ja": "プールは今度また、連れてくから、\n今日は撮影で我慢してくれないか？　お願いだよ。", "zh": "下次再带你去游泳池，今天就先忍耐一下，配合拍摄，好不好？拜托了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_8201_013hib", "source_sha256": "7672dd7cc2559e7e449e8b8ba9b38a76dc21dfbf7719fa2edd0d9608e5d0bea3", "ja": "ズルいぞ～、{$P$}！\nそうやって頼まれると、断れないって知ってるくせに。", "zh": "太狡猾了吧～，{$P$}！\n明明知道你这样拜托我，我就没法拒绝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_8202_013hib", "source_sha256": "5405bdf7995aabee245b625cd7daed15040513444f67ecfa2627e32fa039a3ff", "ja": "今日は仕事に集中する。その代わり……\nまた連れてってくれるって約束、絶対だからね！", "zh": "今天要专心工作。作为交换……\n你答应过还会带我去的，绝对不许反悔哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_8300_p", "source_sha256": "f8cbde89adb7b357744e002fc59333e3be45494fa9c418e6967140755388e09b", "ja": "祈ってみる、とか？\n響の願いが届いて、もしかしたら……。", "zh": "试着祈祷一下，怎么样？\n说不定响的心愿能传达到，也许……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_8301_013hib", "source_sha256": "191468cbdb6855ff6a132d9a03e76807ca6d021f9c2cab7e5382869ccf548e8d", "ja": "……{$P$}ってさ、時々、\nヘンなこと言うよね。お祈りでなんか……。", "zh": "……{$P$}有时候会说些奇怪的话呢。还说什么祈祷……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_8302_p", "source_sha256": "ff7e7bc0424c8de34c7d52b0f44c5267d9e97a332eebdb173381b9bcb5a6efe9", "ja": "頼む、響！　響様～！！", "zh": "拜托了，响！响大人——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_8303_013hib", "source_sha256": "f6292247ef80a2071af4dcd1ee47b04a2105235e3b83049c73f4ec1f1fdce89d", "ja": "わ、わかった！　わかったってば！\nだから手を合わせないで！　恥ずかしいぞ～！", "zh": "我、我知道了！我知道了啦！\n所以别合掌拜我了！很丢人啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
